Frontmatter fields are the top-level keys of its YAML mapping: comments and the items of a
list are skipped, even unindented, and a key holding a list prints alone, as a YAML file's
outline prints it.
== args
input/doc.md
== file input/doc.md
---
# owner: docs
title: Doc
authors:
- name: Alice
---
# Doc
== stdout
input/doc.md (7 lines)
title: "Doc"
authors
[L7-L7] # Doc
== stderr
== exit 0
